{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:61bbe347bb3b071c","name":"Personalized Controls","source":{"id":"source:reference-61bbe347bb3b071c","title":"Personalized Controls","revision":19727,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:30:09Z","sha256":"a25a877b4ebec365f077c24196bf349020bae1a89ecca9553100762139b51574","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19727","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Personalized%20Controls&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-61bbe347bb3b071c","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Emplacement Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Emplacement_Points"},":"]}," 0\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size Restriction:"]}," Colossal or Smaller\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 1,000\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["One advantage of smaller ships is that their controls can be personalized to allow the single character controlling a given ship's function to have everything tuned to his or her preferences. This level of personalization simply isn't possible on ships with dozen or hundreds of crew members.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Any or all of the basic functions performed by a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Space Transport"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Space_Transport"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Copilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Copilot","referenceId":"reference:49f5b0e488cfa66c"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunner"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunner","referenceId":"reference:0cbc0bc5729f801f"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Commander"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Commander","referenceId":"reference:16af7be312e1840b"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["System Operator"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/System_Operator","referenceId":"reference:75f56e8f22b64ca4"},", or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Engineer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Engineer","referenceId":"reference:d93352a70395db3d"}," can be personalized to a single, specific character. (The price listed is for personalizing the controls of one of these positions.) Personalized Controls grant that one character a +1 bonus on checks with any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill"}," relevant to that crew position (usually ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"},", or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"},"). However, the high degree of personalization also makes it more difficult for anyone else to use the controls, giving any other character a -2 penalty on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Checks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Checks"}," relating to the same position.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
